<http://data.silknow.org/object/effc492a-e0e1-393b-8f5e-0de1b4c90885/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "The ground is of red satin.  The design, which is woven with white silk, consists of a medallion enclosing the monogram I. H. S., and a vase of conventional flowers.  Springing from the vase at the top of the medallion are cords and tassels.  On the lower edge is a border of leaves twisting around a stem.  Sewed onto the bottom is a yellow silk fringe."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/effc492a-e0e1-393b-8f5e-0de1b4c90885> .

